{"id":"simplesystemtex","name":"SimpleSystemTeX","aliases":[],"caption":"An automated file &amp; block management system for large-scale LaTeX","authors":[{"id":"zhou-kx","active":true}],"copyright":[],"license":"lppl1.3c","version":{"number":"1.0.0","date":"2026-03-24"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      This LaTeX3 package has been specifically designed for\n      large-scale, integrated typesetting tasks such as books,\n      theses, or extensive lecture notes.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The core design philosophy of this package is to maximize\n      the separation of content and structure.\n      It provides an automated file and block management system\n      that frees content creators from constantly managing\n      global document structure and stylistic details.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      Key features include:\n    <\u002fp>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n        Automated subfile management: Section files are\n        automatically added to the TOC upon import.\n      <\u002fli>\n    <li>\n         A flexible Block System for theorems, definitions,\n         and proofs.\n      <\u002fli>\n    <li>\n        Dynamic cross-referencing that generates and manages\n        anchors automatically.\n      <\u002fli>\n    <li>\n        Automated generation of block indexes\n        (e.g., List of Theorems).\n      <\u002fli>\n    <li>\n        Highly customizable styling via dynamic display arguments\n        and conditional statements.\n      <\u002fli>\n  <\u002ful>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/latex/contrib/simplesystemtex/simplesystemtex.doc.pdf"},{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/latex/contrib/simplesystemtex/README.md"}],"bugs":"https://github.com/JokerXin2025/SimpleSystemTeX/issues","repository":"https://github.com/JokerXin2025/SimpleSystemTeX","ctan":{"path":"/macros/latex/contrib/simplesystemtex","file":true},"miktex":"simplesystemtex","texlive":"simplesystemtex","topics":["book-pub","optimise"]}